# Line endings — LF everywhere, enforced for every clone.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows but runs on Linux: CI on ubuntu-latest, the
# stack in Docker, and `make` from WSL. A CRLF worktree breaks GNU make with
# "\r: command not found" and makes a Windows Git (autocrlf=true) and a WSL Git
# (autocrlf=false) disagree on whether the tree is dirty, on the same checkout.
# `text=auto` still auto-detects binary files and leaves them untouched.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.duckdb binary
*.parquet binary
